1785726249957809	console-w-qw2	itc:v3:AWLJJyZk5JmSeZQAAAAAQdV1tdW1e0AAAAEyBg		item.comment	bn-2r6	{"body":"Implemented in workspace bn-2r6. sprite onion --all <cart> <anim> -o out.png renders a contact sheet: every frame side by side (2px gutters like strip), each with its own loop-aware prev(red)/next(green) onion skin, plus a frame-index caption band below each cell (reuses the --indices 3x5 digit glyphs, scaled 2x). --all and --frame are mutually exclusive (CLI-checked). Added --grid/--anchor to both onion and ghost, mirroring render/strip's exact drawing code. Refactor: new shared view::OverlayOpts{zoom,grid,anchor} replaces the bare zoom:u32 param on onion/ghost/onion_all; updated rpc.rs's sprite_onion (new all bool param) and sprite_ghost mirrors to match, keeping CLI/RPC in lockstep per the module's stated invariant. Tests added to tests/sprite_view.rs (27 total in that file now): contact-sheet dimensions/frame-count, cell-vs-standalone-onion pixel match, loop-awareness of --all (added a non-looping 3-frame fixture anim dot.tri3 to the shared test cart), grid/anchor pixel-diff checks for onion+ghost, a CLI-level --all/--frame conflict test, RPC coverage for grid/anchor/all params. cargo test --workspace green (all suites pass), cargo clippy clean. SKILL.md updated (onion/ghost lines show --all/--grid/--anchor). Committed at 18d102a. Not merged — awaiting lead. Note: this workspace was created --from main per protocol, so it does NOT include bn-3gj's dump/poke changes to view.rs/mod.rs — the lead will need to merge both (non-overlapping regions: bn-3gj added dump-related code + a dump CLI dispatch entry, bn-2r6 changed onion/ghost signatures and added onion_all + CLI dispatch changes for --all; low collision risk but worth a real cargo build after merge)."}	blake3:NxAdtUrZcYHbdDBsBW4aTneRE2Y9u3XB1qyiuDXurEc
