1785772125260668	console-dev	itc:v3:AWLmTP-ZOTJklAAAAAAAQe1v-11rVAAAAAEucw		item.create	bn-3ru	{"description":"Create an original, fun vertical platformer cart that stress-tests the fantasy console as an agent authoring platform. Acceptance: playable title-to-win loop with responsive movement/jump/dash and mutable-map interactions; meaningful use of graphics, sprites/animations, map, draw-state/effects, all seven inputs, music/SFX/advanced instruments, deterministic RNG/logging; exercise console-agent oneshot/RPC, sprite/map/music authoring and inspection surfaces; deterministic scripted verification; package to self-contained HTML and validate it; record concrete tooling/platform rough edges discovered. Testing: cart parse/run, scripted gameplay and state assertions, screenshots visually reviewed, sprite/map/music lints and rendered artifacts reviewed, audio events/stats/spectrogram, replay hash equality, packed web smoke/browser checks, workspace project checks or documented fallback.","kind":"task","labels":["risk:low","game"],"size":"l","title":"Build Lantern Leap platformer showcase cart"}	blake3:6pE2hLEWE7W6WH8KaN1HhyB9ZFEHkQSA0q5NxKMdDY8
