1785773029352082	console-dev	itc:v3:AWLmTP-ZOTJklAAAAAAAQe1v-11rVAAAAAEudw		item.comment	bn-3ru	{"body":"Progress: Built the Lantern Leap cart scaffold, original ABC-derived theme, 13 declared animations/instruments, action SFX, and a two-screen mutable tile-map tower entirely in workspace bn-3ru. Initial title/play/win screenshots are visually coherent; a real movement test collected the first ember and validated hurt/respawn. Music lint is clean with zero clipping. Rough edges so far: output parents are not created; top-level help is stale; and sprite poke/dump against animations with frames_rect silently resolves from the sprite base rect, requiring raw-rect workarounds."}	blake3:IKQNsta1n0dZigYDdtU--DNdnay4R_lKht1TdJa4Tc4
1785773887327893	console-dev	itc:v3:AWLmTP-ZOTJklAAAAAAAQe1v-11rVAAAAAEueA		item.comment	bn-3ru	{"body":"Progress: completed Lantern Leap, an original two-screen platformer with seven-button controls, collectibles, checkpoints, dash, stomp, vines, springs, hazards, pause, win flow, procedural effects, and advanced audio. Exercised all 42 Lua globals, all 28 RPC methods, every sprite/map/music read surface, every mutating authoring verb, ABC import, packer, and real browser pointer/audio paths. Added deterministic progression regressions. Validation: cargo test --workspace PASS; cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets PASS with one pre-existing warning; web smoke PASS; map lint clean; music lint --strict clean; sprite thresholds clean; git diff --check PASS. Workflow defect: just check cannot run because no Justfile."}	blake3:Kknal5sqAZsnhDnYyX89cfVmJaGwbPlGL6K2UfYnE-k
1785773887342421	console-dev	itc:v3:AWLmTP-ZOTJklAAAAAAAQe1v-11rVAAAAAEueQ		item.comment	bn-3ru	{"body":"Self-review: verified title, early game, upper tower, pause, hurt/respawn, all three embers, gate unlock, and settled win screenshots; replayed touch controls and AudioWorklet output from the packed file:// build; confirmed identical deterministic framebuffer/audio results under the same seed and inputs. Scope is limited to one cart, its ABC source, and focused tests."}	blake3:sStqs7IuyRmPK1A7cA9ZdVovUu6U_FPa6OTZ1UOSkhw
