1785773973458405	console-dev	itc:v3:AWLmTP-ZOTJklAAAAAAAQe1v-11rVAAAAAEufA		item.create	bn-2an	{"description":"Lantern Leap dogfooding exposed an ambiguous destructive target.  accepts the animation target but resolves through the base SpriteDef rect, ignoring the animation's  and frame list. It therefore reads or overwrites a valid but wrong sheet region without an error. Make animation targets resolve  through AnimDef::resolve_frame (consistent with render), or reject animation targets and explain the raw-frame alternative. Add dump and poke regressions covering frames_rect and explicit tx:ty frame specs.","kind":"bug","labels":["risk:low"],"size":"m","title":"Sprite dump/poke anim frames ignore frames_rect"}	blake3:qHkWbjdRaD_IqVM0J4H-nCKf6mup2jWXrmCkRRS60Ac
1785773973609077	console-dev	itc:v3:AWLmTP-ZOTJklAAAAAAAQe1v-11rVAAAAAEufQ		item.create	bn-169	{"description":"A first headless Lantern Leap run failed because  did not exist. Screenshot, WAV, spectrogram, sprite/map render, piano-roll, GIF, and pack outputs should consistently create missing parent directories, or all return the same actionable error before running. Add a tempdir regression with a nested output path.","kind":"bug","labels":["risk:low"],"size":"s","title":"Create parent directories for generated artifacts"}	blake3:cPF7D46z351de7dmSajPR2zaaHJvM7V8oSX1em16YKo
1785773973764684	console-dev	itc:v3:AWLmTP-ZOTJklAAAAAAAQe1v-11rVAAAAAEufg		item.create	bn-ps8	{"description":"Repository AGENTS.md and  require  and document , but the repository has no Justfile;  exits 1 with . Add check/install recipes that match the real Rust plus web validation commands, and keep Edict configuration aligned.","kind":"bug","labels":["risk:low"],"size":"s","title":"Add Justfile required by the Edict workflow"}	blake3:nr6Inh7xfs4gy8JiNgkSBeZ4Xv-WrT6Z6rlA_MQYmIU
