1785773974210300	console-dev	itc:v3:AWLmTP-ZOTJklAAAAAAAQe1v-11rVAAAAAEugQE		item.create	bn-3iz	{"description":"The browser/WASM smoke harness is coupled to demo-cart golden hashes, so a newly authored cart cannot be passed through the same automated browser gate. Add a cart argument or generic mode that checks load, multi-frame stepping, nonuniform framebuffer, stable pointers, bounded/nonzero audio when expected, display-palette behavior, and surfaced errors without requiring demo-specific hashes.","kind":"task","labels":["risk:low"],"size":"m","title":"Make web smoke reusable for arbitrary cartridges"}	blake3:tRhA_JeixUrW1mkZyVCll6rQjCMrM6XTjclEYiAUZKY
1785774004329804	console-dev	itc:v3:AWLmTP-ZOTJklAAAAAAAQe1v-11rVAAAAAEuggE		item.update	bn-2an	{"field":"description","value":"Lantern Leap dogfooding exposed an ambiguous destructive target. The command console-agent sprite dump or poke CART player.dash --frame 0 accepts the animation target but resolves through the base SpriteDef rect, ignoring frames_rect=8,0 and the animation frame list. It therefore reads or overwrites a valid but wrong sheet region without an error. Make animation targets resolve --frame through AnimDef::resolve_frame, consistent with render, or reject animation targets and explain the raw-frame alternative. Add dump and poke regressions covering frames_rect and explicit tile frame specs."}	blake3:84lCPLHHsSu6L0nnTLU9CdEaVtWaYHBg2DgkKxOFsCk
1785774004395451	console-dev	itc:v3:AWLmTP-ZOTJklAAAAAAAQe1v-11rVAAAAAEugwE		item.update	bn-169	{"field":"description","value":"A first headless Lantern Leap run failed because the out directory did not exist. Screenshot, WAV, spectrogram, sprite and map render, piano-roll, GIF, and pack outputs should consistently create missing parent directories, or all return the same actionable error before running. Add a temporary-directory regression with a nested output path."}	blake3:wr5rauj7MaeyKdNVHEYcCkRBokbO_KL37ORIRCEAsWA
