1785774004505725	console-dev	itc:v3:AWLmTP-ZOTJklAAAAAAAQe1v-11rVAAAAAEuhQE		item.update	bn-3g4	{"field":"description","value":"The command sprite lint --no-unique-colors classifies every nontransparent color in a legitimate one-frame animation such as player.jump as unique, making the quality gate unusable unless single-frame animations are manually excluded. Treat the comparison as not applicable for one-frame animations or report a targeted diagnostic. Add CLI and RPC regressions."}	blake3:0ZkRYiMRRWwr86zTU8PjJgxBhfxWULCp8A3Wf-5zacw
