1785863845425082	console-dev	itc:v3:AWLmTP-ZOTJklAAAAAAAQe1v-11rVAAAAAEu2AI		item.create	bn-32l	{"description":"Spike paintop as a deterministic external authoring companion without adding a runtime dependency. Build one representative 24x24 frog frame from exact Apollo64 colors using typed image/mask/paint operations, emit and inspect its evidence bundle, pass the PNG through console palette/import dry-run, and measure plan ergonomics and node budget. Document the recommended workflow for the asset bones. If a missing indexed-pixel convenience operation is materially blocking, file an upstream paintop bone plus local tracking; otherwise keep integration documentation-only.","kind":"task","labels":["paintop","art-pipeline","visual-quality"],"parent":"bn-2lm","size":"s","title":"Prove paintop-to-Apollo64 sprite production loop"}	blake3:cFV1wUZzRiuEHrQlCOLIfuVKkUcJC6eymwbZlV4VcUw
