1785863882345253	console-dev	itc:v3:AWLmTP-ZOTJklAAAAAAAQe1v-11rVAAAAAEu3QI		item.comment	bn-204	{"body":"Independent review blocked on three issues. Addressed all: quantizer now collapses into at most 63 weighted Apollo bins with fixed 2 MiB exact RGB tracking (256x256 plasma improved 45.88s to 0.66s, about 69x); RGBA expansion is checked against the 64 MiB cap before allocation with checked arithmetic; reports now honor --format/--json, FORMAT, and TTY conventions. Added stress, cap, alias, and environment regressions. Full just check and docs/skill coverage pass."}	blake3:6kKFthyd_T5JB2nZoZOACfPLvwneDxboRbvZ3BcRVrA
