1785865191548360	console-dev	itc:v3:AWLmTP-ZOTJklAAAAAAAQe1v-11rVAAAAAEu4wI		item.comment	bn-32l	{"body":"Paintop spike complete in workspace bn-32l: a 43-node 24x24 plan renders a byte-deterministic PNG using exactly Apollo64 indices 8,12,14,31,38,48,63 with zero partial-alpha pixels. paintop validate passes; console sprite import --mapping exact --max-colors 8 dry-run passes; a scratch cart import/export was decoded-pixel-identical. Conclusion: use paintop for deterministic composition/material/VFX/evidence, but raw JSON is too verbose for dense atlas work. Paintop accepted a bounded Lua frontend proposal as upstream bn-3tpc and is implementing it in bn-v4fs. Full just check passed."}	blake3:Cs-1mvSpoNEdFYq5NQXvd7hu8Yi3ieMAHwccgdmodyo
