1785895444257351	console-dev	itc:v3:AWLmTP-ZOTJklAAAAAAAQe1v-11rVAAAAAEuuAM		item.create	bn-v3b	{"description":"# Context\nMusic source tooling currently begins at monophonic ABC-to-cart import. Developers need to inspect MIDI as text and audition ABC/MIDI directly through the console synth before deciding how to fit it into cart SFX/pattern limits. The supplied real acceptance file is /home/bob/Downloads/stage-1-the-jungle-.mid: format 1, five tracks, roughly 3:18.\n\n# Goal\nAdd `console music midi-to-abc <in-file> [-o|--out file]` and `console music play <abc|mid>`, backed by one reusable timed-score/MIDI ingestion layer and the console core synthesizer.\n\n# Approach\n- Parse Standard MIDI Files safely with bounded event/note handling, tempo maps, note-on/off pairing, programs, tracks, and actionable diagnostics.\n- Convert MIDI to valid multi-voice ABC on stdout by default or atomically write `-o`/`--out`; preserve timing, voices, title, meter, tempo, rests, and note lengths, and report explicit limitations such as tempo flattening if necessary.\n- Parse ABC and MIDI into a shared timed note score, map up to six simultaneous voices deterministically to console waves/volumes, and render with a small pure console-core preview-synth API.\n- Play rendered 44.1 kHz console samples on the default device, with a bounded preview option suitable for long files and automated/manual testing.\n- Add unit/integration coverage, command help/inventory, SPEC/README, and progressive-disclosure skill docs.\n- Exercise the full Jungle MIDI conversion and a short bounded playback smoke; assess `import-midi` as a follow-up using the same parser rather than silently exceeding cart budgets.\n\n# Acceptance\n- stdout is clean pipeable ABC; `-o` and `--out` write identical bytes.\n- ABC and MIDI playback both use console-core synthesis and handle files longer than three minutes without cart-capacity failures or unbounded parsing.\n- The supplied Jungle MIDI converts successfully and passes a short real-device playback smoke.\n- CLI misuse vs source/device failures use project conventions; help and docs are complete.\n- `just check`, skill coverage, install, and independent review pass.","kind":"task","title":"Add MIDI conversion and source-file synth playback"}	blake3:lQtfVbzrB2aMFc26OWLNBWGxWB6v8IAxaTPPh_W8x6Q
1785895472075713	console-dev	itc:v3:AWLmTP-ZOTJklAAAAAAAQe1v-11rVAAAAAEuuQM		item.move	bn-v3b	{"state":"doing"}	blake3:9tCFuyltGWsZy1gez8ZCjOaQ5OXzMwxNgslnQ4aeC0k
