1786046934156111	console-dev	itc:v3:AWLmTP-ZOTJklAAAAAAAQe1v-11rVAAAAAEuyQQ		item.create	bn-68p	{"description":"Track seal bug bn-3rv9. During Radiant Swarm review cr-2xvvyg, web/engine.js was listed in .sealignore and omitted from changed_files, but seal diff still rendered the ~2.1 MB minified patch body, repeatedly exhausting reviewer context. Close when seal bn-3rv9 lands and the console review workflow confirms ignored patches stay out of all diff output formats.","kind":"task","labels":["tracking"],"title":"[tracking] Seal diff leaks ignored generated files"}	blake3:rv81eIHDd0M_Xifz_in8ngRG4vnnUfhpX7ri6HxuwHY
1786047412334885	console-dev	itc:v3:AWLmTP-ZOTJklAAAAAAAQe1v-11rVAAAAAEuygQ		item.create	bn-2dh	{"description":"Related to bn-1wv. The installed smoke null produced a title-screen screenshot because eval timing is not apparent and the expression is evaluated after frame stepping. Define an explicit, documented phase contract and expose an unambiguous way to run setup code before stepping while retaining a post-run inspection phase. Cover ordering relative to , input application, frame stepping, screenshots, screen text, audio capture, and result serialization. Add CLI help/examples plus native regression tests proving setup eval can create a dense state before capture and post eval can inspect the completed run.","kind":"bug","title":"Define pre-frame and post-frame eval phases for console run"}	blake3:YZCkKw1KXjYsFBkceTSZ6_MfzfuU7HkPa09lr5A1WSM
1786047412725683	console-dev	itc:v3:AWLmTP-ZOTJklAAAAAAAQe1v-11rVAAAAAEuywQ		item.create	bn-1jo	{"description":"Create a second ECS-heavy reference cart in a survivors-like genre to exercise 800-1000 simultaneous enemies, projectiles, pickups, particles, spatial collision work, and frequent spawn/despawn churn. It must remain an actual playable vertical slice rather than a synthetic loop. Define deterministic native and packed-WASM benchmark scenarios, measure frame cost and allocation/churn behavior, expose dropped-spawn and peak-entity telemetry, validate bounded ECS inspection under load, and establish documented performance envelopes for desktop and browser execution. Use the result to identify concrete runtime/tooling bottlenecks and file follow-up bones rather than silently lowering density.","kind":"task","title":"Build a 1000-entity survivors stress cart and ECS ceiling benchmark"}	blake3:S8fQh7AbO9AbRZLnP6Fc19gTeXihbflFRmPOWcMHGio
1786047451671037	console-dev	itc:v3:AWLmTP-ZOTJklAAAAAAAQe1v-11rVAAAAAEuzAQ		item.update	bn-2dh	{"field":"description","value":"Related to bn-1wv. The installed smoke `console run examples/radiant-swarm --frames 60 --eval 'dev_start(); dev_stress()'` produced a title-screen screenshot because eval timing is not apparent and the expression is evaluated after frame stepping. Define an explicit, documented phase contract and expose an unambiguous way to run setup code before stepping while retaining a post-run inspection phase. Cover ordering relative to `_init`, input application, frame stepping, screenshots, screen text, audio capture, and result serialization. Add CLI help/examples plus native regression tests proving setup eval can create a dense state before capture and post eval can inspect the completed run."}	blake3:jAiK0LaB-Nzyc8NUg6JqEyzP19ZHWpK-gSbGdDVFpdI
1786047451685768	console-dev	itc:v3:AWLmTP-ZOTJklAAAAAAAQe1v-11rVAAAAAEuzQQ		item.update	bn-2dh	{"field":"size","value":"m"}	blake3:zX7GyfKBwDrtOS7WHWw5jZ_SwZFx-TVlfMNa4Sc8K80
