1786052422237408	console-dev	itc:v3:AWLmTP-ZOTJklAAAAAAAQe1v-11rVAAAAAEu-AQ		item.create	bn-2go	{"description":"Mirelight Survivors bn-1jo sustains 820 enemies and 931-966 live entities in release, but its 600-frame measured window performs 7,462,950 host allocations and allocates 453,534,523 bytes (about 12,438 calls and 756 KB per frame). Profile and redesign world:each so stable entity queries do not allocate a selected-ID table plus callback argument table for every entity/frame. Preserve deterministic creation order, nested-query behavior, deferred FIFO structural edits, error flushing, native/WASM parity, and existing Lua API. Re-run the Mirelight benchmark without lowering its 800-live floor and document before/after timing and allocation telemetry.","kind":"task","title":"Make Lua ECS each iteration allocation-efficient"}	blake3:B-nC_uY0rxyhjSTIETfdHy9e7s0JCLVLoKFT5uClVS0
