1786053829115632	console-dev	itc:v3:AWLmTP-ZOTJklAAAAAAAQe1v-11rVAAAAAEugQU		item.create	bn-14s	{"description":"While validating bn-2d5 with agent-browser 0.24.1 and Chromium 147, every opened file:// tab was replaced by about:blank after roughly 10-12 seconds. Reproduced with Mirelight packed HTML, Lantern packed HTML, and plain README.md; reproduced with named sessions, AGENT_BROWSER_IDLE_TIMEOUT_MS=120000, and an externally owned Chrome reached via --cdp. Direct CDP WebSocket to the same Chrome retained the file target past 12 seconds. This prevents a truthful 600-frame post-activation browser soak. Track upstream reporting/fix; Console sustained-load harness will own Chromium and use direct CDP meanwhile.","kind":"task","labels":["tracking"],"title":"[tracking] agent-browser file tabs reset to about:blank after about 10 seconds"}	blake3:GcZ3J2g3AMUesg1RcidayYoBDGy47txxLnmgfUxIe2o
1786054111906114	console-dev	itc:v3:AWLmTP-ZOTJklAAAAAAAQe1v-11rVAAAAAEuggU		item.comment	bn-2d5	{"body":"Exact 600-frame browser run exposed agent-browser 0.24.1 replacing file:// targets with about:blank after roughly 10-12 seconds. Reproduced with plain README.md, Lantern Leap, isolated sessions, an explicit 120-second idle timeout, and external Chromium over --cdp. A direct Chrome CDP WebSocket remained on the file past 12 seconds, so the sustained gate is being moved to an owned Chromium process and direct Node WebSocket CDP while short existing gates keep agent-browser."}	blake3:I3qihC1utBZ5NFvf6G7Kc1965xBt7OSpA00GFRiLDho
1786054218030131	console-dev	itc:v3:AWLmTP-ZOTJklAAAAAAAQe1v-11rVAAAAAEugwU		item.comment	bn-2go	{"body":"Optimized world:each in workspace bn-2go: direct stable-order scan replaces the selected-ID snapshot, and bounded 0..16 direct pcall arities replace per-entity component argument tables. Added native regressions for exact select('#', ...) arity/value/order across filters 0..16, nested stable selection + FIFO flush, and nested callback-error depth restoration/flush; extended WASM smoke with empty/max-arity callback checks. Same-workspace release benchmark before -> after: allocation calls 7,462,943 -> 5,056,099 (-32.3%); allocated bytes 453,538,832 -> 326,921,874 (-27.9%); mean 3.386579 -> 2.804133 ms (-17.2%); p95 4.470705 -> 3.262965 ms (-27.0%). Population/churn telemetry is identical and density remains 931 min / 966 peak, 0 drops. Focused native and WASM smoke checks pass; full check and final review remain."}	blake3:udV2_P8SQzILQJ3WP5V3_XEHB8cUk2viOwbiT8H7P1g
1786054338961240	console-dev	itc:v3:AWLmTP-ZOTJklAAAAAAAQe1v-11rVAAAAAEuhAU		item.comment	bn-2go	{"body":"Implemented and committed as 16999fb in Maw workspace bn-2go. world:each now scans the stable creation-order storage directly and invokes callbacks at exact arities 0..16, removing the selected-ID snapshot and per-entity argument-table allocations while preserving nested-query stability, deferred FIFO structural edits, outermost error flushing, selected counts, and native/WASM behavior. Added focused Rust regressions for exact select(\"#\", ...) arities 0..16, deterministic order, nested stable selection/FIFO flushing, and nested callback-error flushing; extended packed WASM smoke coverage for arities 0 and 16. Same-density Mirelight release benchmark before -> after: allocation calls 7,462,943 -> 5,056,099 (-32.3%); allocated bytes 453,538,832 -> 326,921,874 (-27.9%); mean 3.386579 -> 2.804133 ms (-17.2%); p50 3.166172 -> 2.754060 ms (-13.0%); p95 4.470705 -> 3.262965 ms (-27.0%); max 5.846865 -> 4.307244 ms (-26.3%). Gameplay/population telemetry remained exactly 961/931/966 live min peak, 7,824/6,863 spawned/despawned, 0 drops. Peak outstanding was allocator/GC-noisy (3,664,819 -> 4,290,717) and is disclosed in README. Verification: cargo test -p console-core --test ecs; cargo test -p console --test mirelight_survivors; node web/smoke.cjs; both build-cart skill validators; full just check; git diff --check; cargo fmt --all -- --check. All pass. Workspace is clean and intentionally not merged or closed for lead review."}	blake3:AjKZMDlX7dv0y4PW-P2fytRJgQ5prqpBMAj4Yasstkk
1786054347799564	console-dev	itc:v3:AWLmTP-ZOTJklAAAAAAAQe1v-11rVAAAAAEuhQU		item.comment	bn-2d5	{"body":"Direct-CDP rewrite is green. The owned Chromium harness now enables Runtime/Page/Network/Log, sends trusted B/A input, asserts live self-contained console audio, captures snapshots and Page.captureScreenshot, preserves telemetry/no-speed-threshold semantics, and cleans process/profile even on startup failure. Exact 600-frame run advanced 604 frames in 10071.2 ms (59.97 observed FPS), reported zero dropped simulation frames, 16,973,824-byte stable WASM memory, running worklet-data audio at 44.1 kHz with nonzero samples, and no page/network/console/log failures. Artifacts: /tmp/tmp.jz3lOPX19V/2026-08-06T22-09-57-161Z-2292848. node --check, git diff --check, forced /bin/false cleanup probe, and just check all pass."}	blake3:XFXrkOr0eRFfv2IUQNCnrH4mDPgPJz1o6IL7f0d6VaQ
