1786055542663305	console-dev	itc:v3:AWLmTP-ZOTJklAAAAAAAQe1v-11rVAAAAAEuigU		item.create	bn-1ld	{"description":"Fix console serve returning 421 host not allowed when a browser or terminal link handler uses localhost instead of the printed 127.0.0.1 authority. Treat exact localhost and IP loopback literals as one trusted loopback class while continuing to reject unrelated DNS names, non-loopback IPs, and wrong ports. Add unit, socket, real-browser, help, and documentation coverage.","kind":"task","title":"Allow loopback aliases in console serve Host validation"}	blake3:lPzGmeu1_G5HwjvZcTZ5Klmnl32wUZlmW2nxlvyVl5A
