1786055758640958	console-dev	itc:v3:AWLmTP-ZOTJklAAAAAAAQe1v-11rVAAAAAEujgU		item.comment	bn-1ld	{"body":"Reproduced current behavior: printed 127.0.0.1 URL and a real browser succeed, but the identical loopback service with Host localhost returns 421. Implemented loopback-equivalence validation for exact localhost/localhost. and IPv4/IPv6 loopback literals, preserved exact-port and DNS-rebinding rejection, added actionable 421 text, socket/unit coverage, and docs. Workspace debug binary loaded Mirelight successfully in a real browser at http://localhost:<ephemeral-port>. Focused tests and full just check pass; committed f1e6b0d."}	blake3:dG_UtBGOVzOAZ0T3cE4W69g2ijaIEkrCAql5IxfRr34
1786056324860493	console-dev	itc:v3:AWLmTP-ZOTJklAAAAAAAQe1v-11rVAAAAAEujwU		item.comment	bn-1ld	{"body":"Merged to main as 5123dbf216b2 after independent security review cr-i43y44 (LGTM, no findings). Full just check passed. Real browser loaded Mirelight via localhost; independent TCP matrix accepted localhost/localhost./127/8/::1 and rejected unrelated DNS, non-loopback IPs, and wrong ports without cart-source leakage."}	blake3:HlJ6v1LSk_Hvzjd6e6lncv4Zxoq4FQBK-Cs0a0-3qzc
